CoMmAnD->Define INCLUDE
CoMmAnD->About INCLUDE: if it is used full capitaled it use to add or to combine things
CoMmAnD->DO

	CoMmAnD->If CoMmAnD->Tasks->Read->word CoMmAnD->Equal CoMmAnD->To CoMmAnD->Variable->Path
	CoMmAnD->DO
		CoMmAnD->Get CoMmAnD->Variable->Path CoMmAnD->As incpath
		CoMmAnD->Files->Load incpath
		CoMmAnD->As IncBuff
		CoMmAnD->Tasks->Caller->Wordes->Add->Before IncBuff
	CoMmAnD->END DO
	CoMmAnD->ElseIf
	CoMmAnD->DO

	
	CoMmAnD->END DO
	CoMmAnD->Else
	CoMmAnD->DO

	
	CoMmAnD->END DO
CoMmAnD->END DO